Which I think is a bug.

> 3. One can dilute potions and scrolls *for free* while in the water,
> and "drink the surrounding water" for nutrition.
> I seriously wonder if someone could attain foodless conduct using a
> ring of slow digestion while drinking from moats. Does drinking the
> moat provide nutrition?

It doesn't seem so, you just get the message "Do you know what lives
in this water!", and that's it. No nutrition.

> So, to make a long story short, I cleared the summoning storm, entered
> the castle, and stoned everything using a helpfully summoned
> cockatrice. I must say, I never thought I'd clear the castle with an
> amulet of magical breathing. Has anyone else gained so much utility
