I never considered that amulet useless, it's just so rare (too rare)
to make use of it regularily in games. Given that fighting from within
water is restricted to very few specific dungeon levels this does not
make the amulet overly better now, especially since the more common
use is to gain intrinsics from dragons or strength from giants hordes,
but it surely provides a very interesting tactical option in certain
cases. Thanks for pointing out that possibility.

